{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/4681e244f3b2ce9b2796039c4f4291ca.poster.avif?t=1758554301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/4681e244f3b2ce9b2796039c4f4291ca.apng?t=1758554301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=396 height=114 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wildwood Down</strong> is  about a chummy high school senior with Down syndrome who gets thrown head first into a murder mystery along the boardwalk of Wildwood, New Jersey.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With his sister's life on the line, Dan must unravel the case all while navigating eccentric characters and his own unique perspective before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can this unlikely hero outsmart the danger lurking beneath the cheerful fa-cade of America's favorite seaside destination?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/1ccc55611258b0414e258b552690adf9.poster.avif?t=1758554301\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/1ccc55611258b0414e258b552690adf9.webm?t=1758554301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The main character  is voice-acted by the Dev's childhood friend / brother from another mother Daniel himself. He has down-syndrome, a fantastic sense of humor, and loves video games. If anyone deserves his own game it's this guy.\u200b   </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/747f3f37e3566cd736ab91b550e64f3e.poster.avif?t=1758554301\" width=396 height=115 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/747f3f37e3566cd736ab91b550e64f3e.webm?t=1758554301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8-10+ hours of Story-Driven Gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Full Cast of Professional Voice Talent</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack\u00a0<i>&quot;Surf Rock Noir&quot;</i> </strong>(Live Instruments)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funny Rewarding Puzzles with Minimal <i>&quot;Moon Logic&quot;</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Hand Drawn frame-by-frame Pixel Art</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Full Controller Support </strong>(Designed with Steam-Deck in mind)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic 3d - Camera Work / Sound / Lighting</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong> <br><strong>(Cheeky Puzzles add to the humorous dichotomy of the world of Wildwood Down)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist Daniel finds himself making donuts, winning an underground wrestling tournament, and getting thrown out of bars in-order to unveil the murderer of his good friend and hopefully save his sister.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>(<strong>A Fun-tastic Coastal environment with attractive 2D/3D Art)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visuals are a &quot;first-in-it's-class&quot; for the P&amp;C genre. A combination of 2D pixel and 3D graphics with a unique art style that presents eye popping scenery. Wildwood Down pulls players into it's world: cinematic camera work, a 3d soundscape, full character voice acting, and rich retrograde pixel art. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>(An engaging journey with &quot;Daniel&quot; and his eccentric friends)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provides an immersive adventure with quirky but lovable characters full of jokes, spoofs, and other humorous scenes. Be \u2018Dan,\u2019 and unravel the sinister plot of the &quot;Boardwalk Butcher&quot; and help the high school seniors <strong>party on</strong> and <strong>save your sister!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Day 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2575370/53753ac84d940e3d19c5554aa466baeb94ce40b1.jpg"},{"name":"Night 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2575370/e97651295064771006628f145c1f2236661f493e.jpg"},{"name":"Day 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2575370/7b1d0d157a55939617dcb842e5a70bc2112ae8e5.jpg"},{"name":"Night 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2575370/7ad56869339b081ac97d25634ec2c3ecccd1b5c0.jpg"},{"name":"Day 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2575370/190a51a1e2fa69249fba6daf1c47168fdc77747c.jpg"},{"name":"Night 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2575370/9a68fd2d71f2d93994703bcc14fbb1e87f8a30ba.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2575370/cc9dadd734bd4d3563e63986b17349a8a22979ea.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Moltar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2575370/9e5ef8b230900befd453c735dae1968be3b77a6f.jpg"},{"name":"Twister's Toilet Water","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2575370/2a5bfbb9a6048a59d7f6d2ac6567c2ae1777e6d9.jpg"},{"name":"Pong Champ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2575370/92afa441e5bb92d4c0c68b686c189d7abb68e4c4.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2575370?t=1758554301","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2575370?t=1758554301","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/fc3f8cec3004920e143149ac5b586e6c193f7eaa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758554301","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/fc3f8cec3004920e143149ac5b586e6c193f7eaa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758554301","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains occasional cartoon violence and murder victims in certain scenes. Some scenes involve characters drinking alcohol or smoking cigarettes. "},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2699080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/4681e244f3b2ce9b2796039c4f4291ca.poster.avif?t=1758554301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/4681e244f3b2ce9b2796039c4f4291ca.apng?t=1758554301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=396 height=114 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wildwood Down</strong> is  about a chummy high school senior with Down syndrome who gets thrown head first into a murder mystery along the boardwalk of Wildwood, New Jersey.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With his sister's life on the line, Dan must unravel the case all while navigating eccentric characters and his own unique perspective before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can this unlikely hero outsmart the danger lurking beneath the cheerful fa-cade of America's favorite seaside destination?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/1ccc55611258b0414e258b552690adf9.poster.avif?t=1758554301\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/1ccc55611258b0414e258b552690adf9.webm?t=1758554301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The main character  is voice-acted by the Dev's childhood friend / brother from another mother Daniel himself. He has down-syndrome, a fantastic sense of humor, and loves video games. If anyone deserves his own game it's this guy.\u200b   </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/747f3f37e3566cd736ab91b550e64f3e.poster.avif?t=1758554301\" width=396 height=115 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/747f3f37e3566cd736ab91b550e64f3e.webm?t=1758554301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8-10+ hours of Story-Driven Gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Full Cast of Professional Voice Talent</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack\u00a0<i>&quot;Surf Rock Noir&quot;</i> </strong>(Live Instruments)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funny Rewarding Puzzles with Minimal <i>&quot;Moon Logic&quot;</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Hand Drawn frame-by-frame Pixel Art</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Full Controller Support </strong>(Designed with Steam-Deck in mind)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic 3d - Camera Work / Sound / Lighting</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong> <br><strong>(Cheeky Puzzles add to the humorous dichotomy of the world of Wildwood Down)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist Daniel finds himself making donuts, winning an underground wrestling tournament, and getting thrown out of bars in-order to unveil the murderer of his good friend and hopefully save his sister.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>(<strong>A Fun-tastic Coastal environment with attractive 2D/3D Art)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visuals are a &quot;first-in-it's-class&quot; for the P&amp;C genre. A combination of 2D pixel and 3D graphics with a unique art style that presents eye popping scenery. Wildwood Down pulls players into it's world: cinematic camera work, a 3d soundscape, full character voice acting, and rich retrograde pixel art. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>(An engaging journey with &quot;Daniel&quot; and his eccentric friends)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provides an immersive adventure with quirky but lovable characters full of jokes, spoofs, and other humorous scenes. Be \u2018Dan,\u2019 and unravel the sinister plot of the &quot;Boardwalk Butcher&quot; and help the high school seniors <strong>party on</strong> and <strong>save your sister!</strong></p>","developers":["Crashable Studios"],"dlc":[3886740],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/e9e2682bf23379071dffea4f397149ddaca156c5/header.jpg?t=1758554301","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 64-bit or compatible distribution<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 Dual Core or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTS 450 / AMD Radeon HD 5570 (OpenGL 3.2+ support required)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> ALSA or PulseAudio-compatible sound device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires 64-bit system and Steam Linux Runtime</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 64-bit or compatible distribution<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5\u2013i7 Quad Core or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R9 270X (proprietary drivers recommended)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> ALSA or PulseAudio-compatible sound device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Steam Linux Runtime 3.0 (Sniper) recommended for best compatibility</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i3 (Dual Core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or better<br></li><li><strong>Stora